Package: wb-wear-light-gateway
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.9), python3-paho-mqtt, systemd (>= 247)
Recommends: wb-mqtt-confed
Description: local HTTP gateway for the Wiren Board Wear OS light remote
 Bridges authenticated requests from a Wear OS remote to configured
 lighting controls in the local MQTT broker. Provides an on/off switch
 in the Wiren Board configuration editor.
